msgid "ReliefMath 文件与持久化"
msgstr "ReliefMath files and persistence"

msgid ".rmath v1 格式"
msgstr ".rmath v1 format"

msgid ""
"``.rmath`` 是显式编码的 little-endian 字节流；实现不会把 C++ 结构体直接写到磁盘。文件总长度必须与头部的 ``total_bytes`` "
"完全相等，不能包含尾随数据。文件上限为 16 MiB，解码只有在所有字段、UTF-8、记录数量、稳定 ID、样式限制和保留位均通过验证后才替换当前 ``Document``。"
msgstr ""
"``.rmath`` is an explicitly encoded little-endian byte stream; the implementation never writes C++"
" structures directly to disk. File length must exactly equal the header's ``total_bytes``, with no"
" trailing data. The limit is 16 MiB. Decoding replaces the current ``Document`` only after "
"validating all fields, UTF-8, record counts, stable IDs, style limits, and reserved bits."

msgid "顺序：头部; 字段：magic; 宽度：8 字节; v1 要求：``RMATH\\r\\n\\0``"
msgstr "Order: header; Field: magic; Width: 8 bytes; v1 requirement: ``RMATH\\r\\n\\0``"

msgid "顺序：头部; 字段：version; 宽度：u32; v1 要求：``1``"
msgstr "Order: header; Field: version; Width: u32; v1 requirement: ``1``"

msgid "顺序：头部; 字段：total_bytes; 宽度：u32; v1 要求：精确等于整个文件长度"
msgstr "Order: header; Field: total_bytes; Width: u32; v1 requirement: exactly the full file length"

msgid "顺序：头部; 字段：formula_count; 宽度：u32; v1 要求：等于后续记录数，最多 256"
msgstr ""
"Order: header; Field: formula_count; Width: u32; v1 requirement: number of following records, at "
"most 256"

msgid "顺序：头部; 字段：title_bytes; 宽度：u32; v1 要求：UTF-8 标题长度，最多 256 字节"
msgstr ""
"Order: header; Field: title_bytes; Width: u32; v1 requirement: UTF-8 title length, at most 256 "
"bytes"

msgid "顺序：头部; 字段：next_id; 宽度：u64; v1 要求：下一个稳定公式 ID"
msgstr "Order: header; Field: next_id; Width: u64; v1 requirement: next stable formula ID"

msgid "顺序：头部; 字段：title; 宽度：``title_bytes``; v1 要求：UTF-8 字节，不含 NUL"
msgstr ""
"Order: header; Field: title; Width: ``title_bytes``; v1 requirement: UTF-8 bytes without NUL"

msgid "顺序：每条记录; 字段：id; 宽度：u64; v1 要求：非零且在文件内唯一"
msgstr ""
"Order: each record; Field: id; Width: u64; v1 requirement: nonzero and unique within the file"

msgid "顺序：每条记录; 字段：name_bytes; 宽度：u32; v1 要求：名称长度，最多 256 字节"
msgstr ""
"Order: each record; Field: name_bytes; Width: u32; v1 requirement: name length, at most 256 bytes"

msgid "顺序：每条记录; 字段：source_bytes; 宽度：u32; v1 要求：源码长度，最多 64 KiB"
msgstr ""
"Order: each record; Field: source_bytes; Width: u32; v1 requirement: source length, at most 64 KiB"

msgid "顺序：每条记录; 字段：rgba; 宽度：u32; v1 要求：``RRGGBBAA``"
msgstr "Order: each record; Field: rgba; Width: u32; v1 requirement: ``RRGGBBAA``"

msgid "顺序：每条记录; 字段：point_size; 宽度：u16; v1 要求：按模型样式范围验证"
msgstr ""
"Order: each record; Field: point_size; Width: u16; v1 requirement: validate against the model's "
"style range"

msgid "顺序：每条记录; 字段：padding; 宽度：u16; v1 要求：按模型样式范围验证"
msgstr ""
"Order: each record; Field: padding; Width: u16; v1 requirement: validate against the model's style"
" range"

msgid "顺序：每条记录; 字段：display; 宽度：u8; v1 要求：仅 ``0`` 或 ``1``"
msgstr "Order: each record; Field: display; Width: u8; v1 requirement: only ``0`` or ``1``"

msgid "顺序：每条记录; 字段：reserved; 宽度：7 字节; v1 要求：必须全部为零"
msgstr "Order: each record; Field: reserved; Width: 7 bytes; v1 requirement: all zero"

msgid "顺序：每条记录; 字段：name、source; 宽度：变长; v1 要求：分别紧随本记录头部，均为 UTF-8 且不含 NUL"
msgstr ""
"Order: each record; Fields: name, source; Width: variable; v1 requirement: follow this record's "
"header in that order, both UTF-8 without NUL"

msgid ""
"头部固定为 32 字节，每条记录头固定为 32 字节。``revision``、运行期 ``generation``、渲染缓存和路径不持久化。版本不受支持、长度不一致、截断、重复 ID、非法 "
"UTF-8、非零保留位或越界字段都会显式失败；失败时目标 ``Document`` 和文件戳保持原值。"
msgstr ""
"The header is fixed at 32 bytes, as is each record header. ``revision``, runtime ``generation``, "
"render caches, and paths are not persisted. Unsupported versions, inconsistent lengths, "
"truncation, duplicate IDs, invalid UTF-8, nonzero reserved bits, and out-of-range fields "
"explicitly fail. On failure, the target ``Document`` and file stamp retain their original values."

msgid "读取、冲突与原子保存"
msgstr "Reading, conflicts, and atomic saves"

msgid ""
"``read_document(path, document, stamp, error, control)`` 在临时字节缓冲区和临时 ``Document`` "
"中完成读取、摘要与验证，成功后才提交输出。文件戳包含设备号、inode、大小、修改/状态变更时间及内容摘要。符号链接、非普通文件和越界文件会被拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"``read_document(path, document, stamp, error, control)`` reads, hashes, and validates in a "
"temporary byte buffer and temporary ``Document``, committing output only on success. The file "
"stamp includes device number, inode, size, modification/status-change times, and a content digest."
" Symlinks, nonregular files, and out-of-bounds files are rejected."

msgid ""
"``atomic_save(path, document, expected, new_stamp, error, control)`` 先检查目标是否仍与 ``expected`` "
"一致，再在目标同目录以独占创建方式写临时文件。写入会处理 EINTR 和短写；文件数据同步后重新核对冲突，最后在 rename 前再次采样取消状态。成功 rename 后同步父目录。rename "
"前失败会删除临时文件并保留原目标；父目录同步失败则返回 ``Code::Io``，错误明确说明目标已替换但目录持久化未确认，且 ``new_stamp`` 会报告已安装文件。"
msgstr ""
"``atomic_save(path, document, expected, new_stamp, error, control)`` first checks that the target "
"still matches ``expected``, then exclusively creates and writes a temporary file in the target "
"directory. Writes handle EINTR and short writes. After syncing file data, it rechecks conflicts "
"and samples cancellation once more before rename. After successful rename, it syncs the parent "
"directory. Failure before rename removes the temporary file and preserves the original target. "
"Parent-directory sync failure returns ``Code::Io`` with an explicit error that the target was "
"replaced but directory durability is unconfirmed; ``new_stamp`` reports the installed file."

msgid ""
"``IoControl`` 可选地在调用线程中提供 ``cancelled(context)`` 和 ``progress(context, phase, completed, "
"total)``。读写按最多 64 KiB 分块并在分块间检查取消；原子保存另在 rename 前检查。rename 完成后不会响应取消，而会继续同步父目录并按实际结果报告。两个回调都可为 "
"null，默认调用不需要控制对象。调用者应在后台工作线程使用这些同步 API；回调也在该线程执行，不会调用 FLTK。"
msgstr ""
"``IoControl`` may supply ``cancelled(context)`` and ``progress(context, phase, completed, total)``"
" on the calling thread. Reads and writes use chunks of at most 64 KiB, checking cancellation "
"between chunks; atomic saves also check before rename. After rename, cancellation is ignored while"
" parent-directory sync continues and actual results are reported. Both callbacks may be null; "
"default calls need no control object. Callers should use these synchronous APIs in a background "
"worker; callbacks run on that thread too and do not call FLTK."

msgid "冲突检查只能检测戳支持的变化。没有配合锁的外部写入者仍可能在最终检查与 rename 之间修改目标，因此此接口不声称跨程序 compare-and-swap；覆盖冲突应由上层显式处理。"
msgstr ""
"Conflict checks detect only changes represented by the stamp. An external writer without "
"cooperating locks may still change the target between the final check and rename; this interface "
"does not claim cross-program compare-and-swap. Higher layers must explicitly handle overwrite "
"conflicts."

msgid ""
"独立 raw 字节保存 API ``atomic_save_bytes()`` 上限为 128 MiB，以容纳协议导出的单工件（当前 PNG 和 RGBA 上限各为 64 MiB，SVG 为 16"
" MiB）。此上限不改变 ``.rmath`` 的 16 MiB 编解码限制。"
msgstr ""
"The separate raw-byte save API ``atomic_save_bytes()`` allows up to 128 MiB for a single protocol-"
"exported artifact (currently 64 MiB each for PNG and RGBA, 16 MiB for SVG). This does not change "
"the 16 MiB ``.rmath`` encoding/decoding limit."

msgid "恢复快照"
msgstr "Recovery snapshots"

msgid ""
"恢复目录使用绝对 ``XDG_STATE_HOME/reliefmath/recovery``；未设置有效绝对 ``XDG_STATE_HOME`` 时使用 "
"``$HOME/.local/state/reliefmath/recovery``。没有有效绝对 HOME 时返回明确错误。目录路径逐级拒绝符号链接，最终目录归当前用户所有并设为 "
"``0700``；快照与实例锁为当前用户的 ``0600`` 普通文件。"
msgstr ""
"Recovery uses absolute ``XDG_STATE_HOME/reliefmath/recovery``, or "
"``$HOME/.local/state/reliefmath/recovery`` if no valid absolute ``XDG_STATE_HOME`` is set. Missing"
" valid absolute HOME produces an explicit error. Every directory component rejects symlinks. The "
"final directory belongs to the current user with mode ``0700``; snapshots and instance locks are "
"current-user-owned regular files with mode ``0600``."

msgid ""
"目录初始化在每次创建子目录后先 ``fsync`` 其父目录，再打开下一级；已存在的目录项也同步，覆盖失败重试或并发创建后留下的未确认状态。最终目录设为 ``0700`` "
"后再次同步其元数据。同步遇到 ``EINTR`` 会重试，其他失败返回 ``Code::Io``，不提交输出路径或已打开的 "
"``RecoveryStore``；失败可能留下目录，后续重试仍须完成同步。"
msgstr ""
"Directory initialization runs ``fsync`` on the parent after creating each subdirectory, before "
"opening the next level. Existing entries are synced too, covering unconfirmed state from failed "
"retries or concurrent creation. After setting the final directory to ``0700``, its metadata is "
"synced again. Sync retries ``EINTR``; other failures return ``Code::Io`` without committing the "
"output path or opened ``RecoveryStore``. Failures may leave directories behind; later retries must"
" still complete synchronization."

msgid ""
"每个实例以独立 ID 和 ``flock`` "
"锁占有自己的快照。另一个仍持锁的实例不可被列为可恢复项或接管；进程崩溃后锁释放，遗留快照可被发现。快照封装版本、精确长度、仅作显示的原文件路径提示和一个完整 ``.rmath`` v1 文档，并受"
" 128 MiB raw 文件上限约束；内嵌文档仍受 16 MiB 限制。"
msgstr ""
"Each instance owns its snapshot through a separate ID and ``flock`` lock. Another still-locked "
"instance cannot be listed as recoverable or taken over; after a process crash the lock releases "
"and its leftover snapshot becomes discoverable. Snapshots wrap a version, exact length, original-"
"path hint for display only, and one complete ``.rmath`` v1 document. The raw-file limit is 128 "
"MiB; the embedded document remains limited to 16 MiB."

msgid ""
"恢复只把快照加载为新 ``Document``，路径提示不会触发原文件覆盖。取消恢复保留快照；只有显式 ``discard(id, error)`` 才丢弃指定项。实例正常关闭时可调用 "
"``discard_own(error)`` 清理自身快照；没有自身快照时该调用成功且不影响其他实例。删除后目录同步失败会报告快照已移除、持久化未确认。"
msgstr ""
"Recovery only loads a snapshot as a new ``Document``; the path hint never triggers overwriting the"
" original file. Cancelling recovery preserves the snapshot; only explicit ``discard(id, error)`` "
"discards an item. On normal close, an instance may call ``discard_own(error)`` to clean its own "
"snapshot; if none exists, it succeeds without affecting others. Directory-sync failure after "
"deletion reports that the snapshot was removed but durability is unconfirmed."

msgid ""
"``RecoveryStore`` 由单一工作线程独占访问时可安全调用同步的 ``open``、``save``、``list``、``load``、``discard`` 和 "
"``discard_own``。UI 应在对应 job 完成后读取 ``items()``；此容器本身不提供并发同步。恢复保存与加载接受同一可选 ``IoControl``，供后台 job "
"取消及报告进度。"
msgstr ""
"Synchronous ``open``, ``save``, ``list``, ``load``, ``discard``, and ``discard_own`` calls on "
"``RecoveryStore`` are safe when one worker thread has exclusive access. The UI should read "
"``items()`` after the corresponding job finishes; the container itself provides no concurrency "
"synchronization. Recovery save and load accept the same optional ``IoControl`` for background-job "
"cancellation and progress reporting."
